{
  "id": "checked-unchecked",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Önce Denetle",
    "en": "Check First"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "language": "rust",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.rs",
  "solution": "solution.rs",
  "timeout_sec": 45,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`if i >= list.len() { return 0; }` önce gelir.",
      "en": "`if i >= list.len() { return 0; }` comes first."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```rust\nfn get_or_zero(list: &[i32], i: usize) -> i32 {\n    if i >= list.len() {\n        return 0;\n    }\n    // SAFETY: i < len was checked just above.\n    unsafe { *list.get_unchecked(i) }\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", get_or_zero(&[5, 6], 1));\n}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```rust\nfn get_or_zero(list: &[i32], i: usize) -> i32 {\n    if i >= list.len() {\n        return 0;\n    }\n    // SAFETY: i < len was checked just above.\n    unsafe { *list.get_unchecked(i) }\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", get_or_zero(&[5, 6], 1));\n}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "rust_test",
      "tests": [
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(get_or_zero(&[5, 6], 1), 6);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "içeride",
            "en": "inside"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(get_or_zero(&[5, 6], 2), 0);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "sınırda",
            "en": "at the boundary"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(get_or_zero(&[], 0), 0);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "boş",
            "en": "empty"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_require",
      "pattern": "get_unchecked",
      "show": "get_unchecked"
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_forbid",
      "pattern": "list\\[",
      "show": "list["
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_forbid",
      "pattern": "\\.get\\(",
      "show": ".get("
    }
  ]
}
